      "side": 1,
      "message": "This allocation might come from trapping a guest ff-a call. If we have a different error code than `-ENOMEM` then I am not how this would map to an ff-a error code returned to the guest and how recovarable this is. By looking at the source code of the hyp allocator we can return -EINVAL or -E2BIG when things go wrong.",
